<title>UK: SOCCER-TURKEY BEAT WALES 3-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TURKEY BEAT WALES 3-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>EBBW VALE, Wales 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey beat Wales 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>seven qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Serkan Aykut 29, 80, Serdar Topraktepe 73.</p>
<p>Attendance: 700</p>
</text>
